{"src":"en","tgt":"fr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":147400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"fr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5807.957839000001,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6118.581711999999,"text":"Les lions sont les félins les plus sociaux, vivant en grands groupes appelés troupes."},{"kind":"audio","t":6173.462203000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6175.307116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6176.449683999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":6176.651787000001,"samples":11496,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":16431.546008999998,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important. They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":16899.867764,"text":"Dans le climat chaud du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante. Ce sont presque toutes des plages de sable où la baignade est sûre, et la plupart offrent de l'ombre grâce à"},{"kind":"audio","t":16953.094609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16954.752881999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16956.296221999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":16956.492797,"samples":11496,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":120},{"kind":"audio","t":16990.851427999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16992.584703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16994.559983,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":16996.168440999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16997.100801999997,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":19268.378394,"text":"Bohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":19388.251296,"text":"des arbres bohicans."},{"kind":"audio","t":19438.552142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19438.916128999997,"samples":11632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":29442.380171999997,"text":"Prides are made up of one to three related adult males along with us. Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":29961.004896,"text":"Les troupes sont composées d'un à trois mâles adultes apparentés ainsi que nous. Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir subi des maltraitances graves ou des traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"audio","t":30015.670133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30017.204579999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30018.989413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30019.312108,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"audio","t":30061.221319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30062.992532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30064.786057999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30066.441435999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30068.252589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30068.797016999997,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":34421.454672,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 traverse regularly to Centra, stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":34857.954211000004,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scottport fait régulièrement le trajet vers Centra, avec un arrêt à Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":34904.89828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34906.272466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34908.326765000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34909.959349000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34911.380185,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"input","t":40402.883466,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":40951.377272000005,"text":"Pour profiter des meilleures vues de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et dirigez-vous vers le front de mer de Kowloon, juste en face."},{"kind":"audio","t":41010.01417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41011.505432000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":41013.177255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41015.011612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41016.772199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41016.946651000006,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45408.212946,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":45811.934419000005,"text":"Les points de vue d'Aristote étaient acceptés sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la physiologie."},{"kind":"audio","t":45856.950511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45858.606601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45860.343171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45862.044469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45862.93653,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":54584.532965000006,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor."},{"kind":"text","t":55005.914777000005,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gowrie a terminé 11e du Super G debout masculin, le concurrent de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":55062.637487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55064.203401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55066.013582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55067.72208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55067.958987000005,"samples":12328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":60563.138114,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":60858.846565,"text":"Ulrich Joklin a terminé 16e du Super G assis masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":60912.890047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60914.434028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60916.132271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":60916.284169000006,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66618.114059,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":67023.719996,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les autres villes du pays car elle a davantage un style arabe qu'un style arabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":67087.497701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67089.045768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67090.73864299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67092.51682599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67094.30994199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":67094.42928099999,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":76698.220997,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":77245.859258,"text":"De plus, après la révolution, les postes étaient ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus performants de réussir."},{"kind":"audio","t":77307.231997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77308.599754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77310.345137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77312.027206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77313.838168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":77315.643292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77316.21362899999,"samples":18192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":83402.07221,"text":"The fusion bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":83887.090745,"text":"La bombe à fusion repose sur le principe qu'il faut de l'énergie pour assembler un noyau comportant de nombreux protons et neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":83946.285291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83947.87500999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83949.519963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83951.296644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83953.09753099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83954.046879,"samples":24560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":88729.54788299999,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":89231.307955,"text":"Il n'a pas fixé de montant pour les coupes, déclarant qu'elles seront effectuées en fonction de la production économique de la Chine."},{"kind":"audio","t":89290.10248999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89291.495604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":89293.4887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89295.25384399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89297.024565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89297.620742,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":96301.71945799999,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":96671.361211,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle pour déterminer quels articles manufacturés sont des antiquités. Certaines administrations fiscales définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans."},{"kind":"audio","t":96717.12408499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96718.759994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96720.514772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":96722.365244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96724.189336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":96724.326642,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":96752.043188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96753.994371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96755.85778199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96756.160958,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":103568.847429,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":103944.18643599999,"text":"Dans l'archipel et les lacs, vous n'avez pas nécessairement besoin d'un yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":103997.8115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103999.29346799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104001.094275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":104001.318632,"samples":10896,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":111909.005809,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":112567.45962499999,"text":"Le rapport d'aspect de ce format, en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le rapport d'entiers le plus simple, est donc dit être de 3 pour 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":112627.11192899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":112628.979576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112630.455795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":112632.35371899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112633.99477599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112635.761151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":112635.896725,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120295.00514,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":120904.469251,"text":"Il est réputé pour être un épicentre du luxe qui a débuté vers 400 apr. J.-C. et a duré jusqu'à"},{"kind":"audio","t":120959.30308099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120960.95942099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120962.618395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120963.59297,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"audio","t":120997.90059399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120998.29728,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":124481.60979199999,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":124715.87062999999,"text":"environ 1100 apr. J.-C."},{"kind":"audio","t":124765.325074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124765.77506,"samples":14632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"audio","t":124799.145034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":124799.30862,"samples":832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":132209.558322,"text":"...policies vary, but as of late March, most coronavirus-based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics..."},{"kind":"text","t":132911.244729,"text":"...les politiques varient, mais fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation liées au coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux olympiques..."},{"kind":"audio","t":132975.84992799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132977.30792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132979.05059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132980.83637499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132982.630281,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132984.408705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":132986.234429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132986.972449,"samples":19624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":140500.054426,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball WOOOOOO"},{"kind":"text","t":141049.434284,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches, puis, avec des mains propres et humides, pressez-les pour former une boule WOOOOOO"},{"kind":"audio","t":141108.566406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141109.906651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141111.546516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":141113.327984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141113.936659,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":147085.697108,"text":"Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":147348.67766,"text":"Les passagers de croisière sont exemptés des exigences de visa."},{"kind":"audio","t":147402.849575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147404.39594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147406.196206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":147406.33161,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":157503.295649,"code":1005}]}